@startuml
autonumber
hide footbox
title To place a bid on an auction

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : I want to place a bid\non this auction
activate System
System --> Buyer : Provide the value of your bid
deactivate System

Buyer -> System : value
activate System

System --> Buyer : Your bid was placed successfully
deactivate System

@enduml